      "author_association": "MEMBER",
      "body": "Concept NACK. As [already stated](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36878#pullrequestreview-5921826795) yesterday on the previous PR, this is touching tricky consensus critical code written by Satoshi Nakamoto 16 years ago (4bd188c4383d6e614e18f79dc337fbabe8464c82) for no perceptible benefit (this is very far from the worst case if anybody tries to maliciously increase validation cost, and nowhere near the bottleneck for any non-malicious usage).\n\nI don't really understand why you would re-open a PR that was closed on conceptual grounds, by slightly changing the approach but not addressing said conceptual objections.",
